A Python package implemented in Rust with [PyO3](https://pyo3.rs), built by
[maturin](https://www.maturin.rs).

## Development

Requires [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/), [rustup](https://rustup.rs) and
[just](https://just.systems/). `just doctor` lists any missing cargo tools
with install commands.

```sh
just setup   # create the environment (builds the extension), install git hooks
just check   # format check, lint, type check, Rust and Python tests
just         # list every recipe
```

| Task | Python | Rust |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Build and dependencies | uv, maturin | cargo |
| Format and lint | ruff | rustfmt, clippy |
| Type check | ty | - |
| Tests and coverage | pytest, pytest-cov | cargo-nextest, cargo-llvm-cov |
| Dependency policy | - | cargo-deny |
| Docs | MkDocs Material, mkdocstrings | rustdoc |

Git hooks run through prek. The repository carries Claude Code settings
(`CLAUDE.md`, `.claude/`): edits are auto-formatted, `just check` runs before
Claude finishes a task, and the Astral and `rust-analyzer-lsp` plugins provide
the ty and rust-analyzer language servers.
